## The runtime

This game stands on no engine, so the runtime under it is yours to write:
the frame loop and the delta time it measures, the canvas fit, input from
both the keyboard and the pointer, audio cues, loading the images and sounds
this build produces, and the debug overlay. Where this specification speaks
of the runtime it means that layer, and it states only what Orrery needs
from it. How the layer is structured is yours to decide.
